{
  "name": "Inner Alchemy",
  "type": "feat",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>As a Bonus Action, you can suspend the effect of one potion with a duration of more than 1 minute currently affecting you. You can resume the effect of one potion suspended in this manner at any time as a Bonus Action. Deduct the time of the potion's effect in increments of 1 minute. When you finish a Long Rest, all potion effects still suspended on you end.</p>",
